        "In loan application reference number {CTRL}, a farmer [listed three tractors the farm did not own|gave the farm's size as twelve hectares instead of eleven and a half].",
        "A museum label, reviewed under reference number {CTRL}, [called a modern replica a genuine ancient vase|dated a vase to about the year eighteen hundred, within the experts' range].",
